    <description>Zenthera Patient Support Program (PSP) specialist for patient medication facts from CRM data, read-only: refill history and next refill due date for one patient (recorded shipments only), delayed or long-shipped shipments, and the program exceptions list (overdue refills, delayed shipments, consent pending, open safety reviews, duplicate or uncategorised cases, missing data). Use for &apos;show today&apos;s PSP program exceptions&apos;, &apos;which shipments are delayed&apos;, &apos;when is &lt;patient&gt;&apos;s next refill due&apos;. Not for program policy questions or creating cases.</description>
